<title>INDIA: Delhi bourse closed for national holiday.</title>
<headline>Delhi bourse closed for national holiday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Delhi Stock Exchange was closed on Thursday for a national holiday marking the centenary of the birth of Indian freedom fighter Subhas Chandra Bose.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, the exchange's sensitive index closed 3.72 points higher at 720.90.</p>
<p>Trade was due to resume on Friday.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
